| `apps/web/src/pages/LandingPage.tsx` and `apps/web/src/locales/en/translation.json`      | Marketing copy still promises escrow protection on the landing experience.                                        | Escrow promise language removed in Tranche 2.                             |
| `apps/web/src/pages/customer/CustomerNoApplicantRescuePage.tsx`                          | Primary CTA says “Boost visibility.”                                                                              | Boost language replaced with Phase 1 recovery actions in Tranche 2.       |
| `apps/web/src/layout/AdminLayout.tsx`                                                    | Active admin navigation still exposes `Payouts` and `Pricing`.                                                    | Payouts and Pricing removed from AdminLayout in Tranche 2.                |
| `apps/web/src/pages/tasker/VerificationGatePage.tsx` and other tasker verification pages | Verification is in scope, but the pages are extremely thin compared with the screen specs.                        | Verification pages remain launch-live; polish applied in Tranche 3.       |

### Mobile (all resolved)

| File                                                                                                 | Issue                                                                                                | Resolution                                                                   |
| ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `apps/mobile/src/app/(customer)/bookings/[bookingId]/cancel.tsx`                                     | TODO: real cancellation policy and API submit are not wired.                                         | Wired to real SDK hooks in Tranche 4.                                        |
| `apps/mobile/src/app/(customer)/bookings/[bookingId]/index.tsx`                                      | TODO: completion and no-show calls are still placeholders.                                           | Wired to real SDK hooks in Tranche 4.                                        |
| `apps/mobile/src/app/(tasker)/jobs/[bookingId]/cancel.tsx`                                           | TODO: real cancellation policy and API submit are not wired.                                         | Wired to real SDK hooks in Tranche 4.                                        |
| `apps/mobile/src/app/(tasker)/jobs/[bookingId]/index.tsx`                                            | TODO: no-show flow is still placeholder behavior.                                                    | Wired to real SDK hooks in Tranche 4.                                        |
